### Query 8 — Average Sale vs Rent
*Compare average sale per customer with average rent per city.*

```sql
SELECT 
    c.city_name,
    ROUND(AVG(CAST(s.total AS INTEGER)), 2) AS avg_sale_per_customer,
    CAST(c.estimated_rent AS INTEGER)       AS avg_rent,
    ROUND(AVG(CAST(s.total AS INTEGER)) / 
          CAST(c.estimated_rent AS INTEGER), 2) AS sale_to_rent_ratio
FROM sales s
JOIN customers cu ON s.customer_id = cu.customer_id
JOIN city c       ON cu.city_id = c.city_id
GROUP BY c.city_name, c.estimated_rent
ORDER BY avg_sale_per_customer DESC;
```

