## 3. KEY BUSINESS INSIGHTS

| # | Insight |
|---|---------|
| 1 | **حلب** is the #1 revenue city (1.26M) with 900K potential consumers |
| 2 | **Cold Brew Coffee Pack** is the top-selling product (1,326 units sold) |
| 3 | **Peak season** was Sep–Nov 2023 with explosive growth (+169%) |
| 4 | **القنيطرة** has the best sale-to-rent efficiency ratio (0.09) |
| 5 | **حمص & حماة** have the highest active customer base (69 & 68 unique buyers) |
| 6 | Total Q4 2023 revenue: **1,963,300** — strongest quarter |
| 7 | Average sale per transaction hovers around **550–612** across all cities |

